id: pm-tuxw1i
title: Exclude five repository-only docs from the npm tarball to restore publication headroom for the collection-mutation bundle
description: "Next pm-998juj tranche, required before the collection-mutation bundle (pm-gh1700, pm-pwqiao, pm-4yxzvd) can publish. After PR 1701 the base distribution sits at 19,999,051 of 20,000,000 bytes (949 B left), so any packaged byte the bundle adds fails the base artifact gate. Two docs are repository-specific and the same class as the excluded docs/ECOSYSTEM_PLANNING_REVIEW.md and docs/CHATGPT_CODEX_PLUGIN_IMPLEMENTATION.md. docs/DEVELOPMENT_DEPENDENCY_SECURITY.md (15,639 B) documents this repository's contributor gate, pnpm quality:dependencies over this lockfile. docs/CONTEXT_ALGORITHM_PORTFOLIO.md (16,337 B) is a navigation index whose queries only resolve against this repository's tracker (its algorithm-proposal tags and their owners). Nothing in src, scripts, tests, plugins, packages or the guide topics reads either file. Packaged links: docs/TESTING.md links the first; docs/README.md and the pm-user skill reference ECOSYSTEM_PLANNING.md link the second. Duplicate check: pm-998juj children, pm-7ouxrr and pm-1ke3mz; search for both file names found no owner."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: artifact,npm,package-size,release
created_at: "2026-11-11T05:16:10.200Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-11T08:05:44.924Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-11T08:02:17.078Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-11T08:02:17.078Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "package.json files excludes docs/DEVELOPMENT_DEPENDENCY_SECURITY.md and docs/CONTEXT_ALGORITHM_PORTFOLIO.md and docs-reachability-exceptions.json records why for each; Every packaged link to either doc is a canonical GitHub URL with the repository-only exclusion stated beside it; A clean build passes scripts/release/package-artifact-gate.mjs and the Sentry-injected simulation with the collection-mutation bundle included; package.json also excludes docs/RELEASE_RELIABILITY.md, docs/RELEASE_LEDGER_RECONCILIATION.md and docs/PR_REVIEW_LOOP.md with recorded reasons, and update.ts declares its removal selector locally so the dependency-removal declarations stay out of the packed declaration closure"
parent: pm-998juj
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "package.json excludes DEVELOPMENT_DEPENDENCY_SECURITY.md, CONTEXT_ALGORITHM_PORTFOLIO.md, RELEASE_RELIABILITY.md, RELEASE_LEDGER_RECONCILIATION.md and PR_REVIEW_LOOP.md, with reasons in docs-reachability-exceptions.json and canonical-URL links in packaged pages. update.ts keeps the removal selector local so dependency-removal declarations stay out of the packed closure."
expected_result: A clean build fits the base artifact budget with the bundle included
actual_result: "Base distribution 19,989,811 of 20,000,000 B (10,189 B headroom); Sentry-injected simulation 20,270,125 of 20,300,672 B"
