comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-11T05:18:01.734Z","harness:claude-code","Measured 2026-11-11 after a clean rm -rf dist and pnpm build on branch fix/collection-mutation-receipts with only this tranche applied. scripts/release/package-artifact-gate.mjs passes the base profile at 19,967,440 of 20,000,000 bytes (32,560 B headroom, up from 949 B) across 1,591 distribution files. Both docs stay in the repository and remain reachable through canonical GitHub URLs."
  "2026-11-11T08:01:09.449Z","harness:claude-code","Extended 2026-11-11 after the bundle's first clean build failed the base gate at 20,014,847 of 20,000,000 bytes. A packlist diff against this tranche's first commit (ec494f69e) put the bundle's growth at 47,427 B: dist/sdk +23,731, dist/cli-bundle +17,584, docs +5,193. Three fixes followed. Three more repository-only docs are excluded: RELEASE_RELIABILITY.md and RELEASE_LEDGER_RECONCILIATION.md describe this repository's Release Reliability workflow, and PR_REVIEW_LOOP.md documents scripts/reviews/pr-review-loop.mjs, which the package does not ship. Next, update.ts declares its DependencyRemovalSelector locally and the test seam no longer re-exports the moved helpers, so dependency-removal.d.ts falls out of the packed declaration closure. The agent-task token corpus and baseline JSON stay packaged, because docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md calls the baseline published evidence. Result: base distribution 19,989,811 of 20,000,000 B (10,189 B headroom, 1,589 files), and the Sentry-injected simulation at 20,270,125 of 20,300,672 B."
  "2026-11-11T08:05:44.924Z","harness:claude-code","Correction to the close reason: this tranche excludes five docs, not six. They are DEVELOPMENT_DEPENDENCY_SECURITY.md, CONTEXT_ALGORITHM_PORTFOLIO.md, RELEASE_RELIABILITY.md, RELEASE_LEDGER_RECONCILIATION.md and PR_REVIEW_LOOP.md. The title now names the count. The previous title mentioned the dependency-security doc by name, and pm-changelog 2026.11.10 classified the entry under Security from that title word alone. That is a classifier precedence defect filed upstream as https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/issues/340."
